{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2019-09-30 22:30:00', 'title': 'AT&T COMMUNICATIONS SAYS CWA-REPRESENTED EMPLOYEES HAVE VOTED TO RATIFY 3 AGREEMENTS IN SOUTHEAST CWA CONTRACT NEGOTIATIONS', 'text': 'OCT 1  - AT&T COMMUNICATIONS::CWA-REPRESENTED EMPLOYEES VOTE TO RATIFY SOUTHEAST AGREEMENTS.AT&T COMMUNICATIONS - FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENTS COLLECTIVELY COVER ABOUT 20,000 EMPLOYEES IN CWA DISTRICT 3.AT&T COMMUNICATIONS - CWA-REPRESENTED EMPLOYEES HAVE VOTED TO RATIFY THREE AGREEMENTS IN SOUTHEAST CWA CONTRACT NEGOTIATIONS.AT&T COMMUNICATIONS- RATIFIED AGREEMENTS INCLUDE SOUTHEAST WIRELINE AGREEMENT, BELLSOUTH TELECOMMUNICATIONS - UTILITY OPERATIONS, AT&T BILLING SOUTHEAST.'}